{"source_paper_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011","question_group":"Q13","source_pdf_page":2,"parent_original_printed_prompt":"下列關於「月相變化」的敘述，正確畫○，不正確打〤。","items":[{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|001","original_item_stem":"兩次的滿月之間大約經過29或30天。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,212.3,416.2,227.31]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|002","original_item_stem":"月相變化跟農曆日期有關。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,230.9,416.2,245.91]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|003","original_item_stem":"每個月從上弦月到下弦月大約需要一星期。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,249.5,416.2,264.51]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|004","original_item_stem":"只要看不到月亮就一定是農曆初一。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,268.1,416.2,283.11]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|005","original_item_stem":"農曆一個月中只會出現一次上弦月。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,286.7,416.2,301.71]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|006","original_item_stem":"農曆15日至農曆26日的月相變化是圓到缺。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,305.3,416.2,320.31]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|007","original_item_stem":"農曆七夕情人節(七月初七)的月相是下弦月。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,324,416.2,339.01]},{"source_id":"SCI_G04_S1_114_MID_011|Q13|008","original_item_stem":"一天中，每隔3小時一次，觀察紀錄三次以上，就可以看到上弦月、望月和殘月。","marker_bbox_pts":[388.4,342.6,416.2,357.61]}]}
